<h1>VCard</h1>

<p>The VCard component generates a contact card in vCard 3.0 format and triggers a browser download when activated. Share contact information directly from your site — visitors can save it to their phone or desktop contact manager in one tap.</p>

<p>All contact fields are CMS-bindable, making this ideal for employee directories, speaker pages, and contact listings.</p>

<p><strong>Group:</strong> Interactive</p>

<p><strong>Demo:</strong> <a href="https://webflow-core-component-test.webflow.io/vcard">webflow-core-component-test.webflow.io/vcard</a></p>

<h2>Best Practices</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Full Name is required.</strong> First Name and Last Name are also recommended as separate fields for better compatibility with contact apps.</li>
  <li>VCards are primarily useful on mobile. Consider hiding the component on tablet and desktop breakpoints, or placing it in a mobile-only section.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Properties</h2>

<h3>Display</h3>

<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>variant</code></td><td>Variant</td><td><code>Button</code></td><td><code>Button</code> — renders a built-in download button. <code>Slot</code> — wraps custom content; clicking anywhere inside triggers the download.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>buttonText</code></td><td>Text</td><td><code>Save to Contacts</code></td><td>Label text for the built-in button. Only used when <code>variant</code> is <code>Button</code>.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>buttonStyle</code></td><td>Text</td><td><code>''</code></td><td>Inline CSS applied to the built-in button. Only used when <code>variant</code> is <code>Button</code>.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>Slot</code></td><td>Slot</td><td>—</td><td>Custom clickable content. Only used when <code>variant</code> is <code>Slot</code>.</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>Download</h3>

<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>filename</code></td><td>Text</td><td><code>contact.vcf</code></td><td>The downloaded file name. <code>.vcf</code> is automatically appended if not already present.</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

